// The bulk of everything below.
//
// One of the three blocks the world is currently made of. Every block
// needs an item of the *same name* to drop anything at all -- that is the
// placeholder drop policy (PHASE2_ARCHITECTURE.md 4.1), replaced by real
// `drops:` tables in block 2.4. Without this file, breaking this block
// silently yields nothing.
ItemDef(
    name:       "cubara:stone",
    max_stack:  64,
    durability: None,
)
